    {
      "id": 213679,
      "name": "Paul",
      "username": "Paul",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-01-19T21:54:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>All of the preorders from the old store (which are now just Prime War and OblivAeon-related stuff) have been saved in a spreadsheet entitled \"Old Store Preorders\", which we'll print and ship from as appropriate :)</p><p>New preorders on the new web store just stick around in the system and can be easily bulk printed as soon as the items are back in stock - it is great!</p><p>Speaking of which, all of the Spirit Island preorders we had on hand from the new web store were sent out two days ago, and I *believe* that all of the tracking info for those was automatically updated on the new web store.</p><p>If you have any old preorders not covered here, let me know and I'll look into them!</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:44:42.816Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
