      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 17713,
      "topic_slug": "separate-account-for-store",
      "display_username": "Paul",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "Judges",
      "flair_url": "scale-balanced",
      "flair_bg_color": "7700ff",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 42,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "Chief Justice",
      "title_is_group": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>All of the preorders from the old store (which are now just Prime War and OblivAeon-related stuff) have been saved in a spreadsheet entitled \"Old Store Preorders\", which we'll print and ship from as appropriate :)</p><p>New preorders on the new web store just stick around in the system and can be easily bulk printed as soon as the items are back in stock - it is great!</p><p>Speaking of which, all of the Spirit Island preorders we had on hand from the new web store were sent out two days ago, and I *believe* that all of the tracking info for those was automatically updated on the new web store.</p><p>If you have any old preorders not covered here, let me know and I'll look into them!</p>",
